  "worked_solution": "In the model, we have $\\frac{1}{12}$ multiplied by $4.$ This means that we need to make $4$ copies of the given fraction model.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129500/assets/b2f9c1667013d19d6d80ad7d3f77dfed4160f8d8459cfdf53ac7407d42e32dfc.png)\n\n \n\nSo, the missing picture is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129500/assets/fcfeaf1b1954b047672ef4dcbde5f9f0461cacd10aa7adc954570c239e6a0434.png)",
